---

<section id="about" class="about-section">
  <!-- Subtle Background Glow -->
  <div class="ambient-glow glow-about"></div>

  <div class="container about-container">
    <!-- Left Column: Portrait Avatar Box with Frosted Glass Brutalism -->
    <div class="about-visual scroll-reveal">
      <div class="avatar-box brutalist-card">
        <!-- Profile Picture from public directory -->
        <img
          src="/ahnaf.JPG"
          alt="Ahnaf Bhamakerti Arief"
          class="avatar-img"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Biography & Frosted Stats Grid -->
    <div class="about-content scroll-reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
      <!-- Section Tag Header -->
      <div class="about-header-split">
        <span class="about-index">02 / STORY</span>
        <h2 class="about-title gradient-text">ABOUT</h2>
      </div>

      <h3 class="about-subtitle">FRONTEND DEV LEARNING THE FULL STACK.</h3>

      <p class="about-desc">
        Halo! Saya <strong>Ahnaf Bhamakerti Arief</strong>, lulusan
        <strong>Teknik Informatika</strong> dari <strong>Universitas Negeri Semarang</strong>.
        Saya memulai perjalanan di dunia web development sebagai frontend developer menggunakan React dan Next.js.
        Saat ini, saya sedang aktif mempalajari mengenai website modern menggunakan Astro.js serta mengeksplorasi mengenai arsitektur full-stack.
      </p>

      <p class="about-desc">
        Bagi saya, menulis kode bukan sekadar membuat website berfungsi. Saya selalu fokus pada kerapian struktur kode, responsivitas halaman, kecepatan load website, serta ketelitian agar hasilnya benar-benar sesuai dengan kebutuhan.
      </p>

      <p class="about-desc">
        Selain web development, saya juga memiliki minat pada UI/UX design. Pemahaman di bidang ini membantu saya melihat website dari sudut pandang pengguna, agar website yang dibuat tidak hanya berjalan lancar tetapi juga terasa mudah dan nyaman digunakan.
      </p>

      <!-- Raw Bordered Stats Grid (Strictly divided by thin lines like reference screenshot) -->
      <div class="about-stats-grid brutalist-card">
        <div class="stat-cell border-bottom border-right">
          <span class="stat-value gradient-text">4</span>
          <span class="stat-label">TAHUN BELAJAR</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-cell border-bottom">
          <span class="stat-value gradient-text">3.71</span>
          <span class="stat-label">IPK / GPA</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-cell border-right unnes-logo-cell">
          <img
            src="/unnes-logo.png"
            alt="Logo UNNES"
            class="unnes-logo-img"
            onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='block';"
          />
          <span
            class="stat-value gradient-text fallback-unnes-text"
            style="display:none;">UNNES</span
          >
          <span class="stat-label">UNIVERSITAS NEGERI SEMARANG</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-cell">
          <span class="stat-value gradient-text">IDN</span>
          <span class="stat-label">SEMARANG / INDONESIA</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    background-color: var(--bg-primary);
    position: relative;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--color-border);
    transition: background-color 0.5s ease;
  }

  .glow-about {
    width: 320px;
    height: 320px;
    background-color: var(--color-accent-glow);
    top: 25%;
    right: 5%;
    filter: blur(80px);
  }

  .about-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 3.5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* Left Column Visual */
  .about-visual {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .avatar-box {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 380px;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-border);
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px var(--color-border);
  }

  .avatar-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    transition: var(--transition-smooth);
  }

  .avatar-box:hover .avatar-img {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  /* Right Column Content */
  .about-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .about-header-split {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .about-index {
    font-family: var(--font-subheading);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .about-title {
    font-size: 3rem;
    line-height: 0.8;
  }

  .about-subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-subheading);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  .about-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    text-align: justify;
  }

  /* Frosted stats grid wrapper */
  .about-stats-grid {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    padding: 0; /* Align boundaries with card border */
    border-radius: 0;
    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px var(--color-border);
  }

  .stat-cell {
    padding: 1.8rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    transition: var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .stat-cell:hover {
    background-color: rgba(18, 28, 21, 0.03);
  }

  .stat-cell.border-right {
    border-right: 1.5px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .stat-cell.border-bottom {
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .stat-value {
    font-family: var(--font-subheading);
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  /* UNNES Logo cells and custom sizing */
  .unnes-logo-cell {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .unnes-logo-img {
    height: 40px;
    width: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15)) grayscale(10%)
      contrast(110%);
    transition: var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .unnes-logo-img:hover {
    transform: scale(1.05);
    filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25)) grayscale(0%)
      contrast(115%);
  }

  .fallback-unnes-text {
    font-size: 2rem !important;
  }

  /* Screen Size Queries */
  @media (min-width: 992px) {
    .about-container {
      grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
      gap: 5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
